{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1759","id":4156009060,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p873t6pk","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1759","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1759.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1759.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1759","number":1759,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Repair Functions predecessor release routing","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nThis repair addresses the late unresolved review finding on merged PR #1758. The historical issue #1748 Functions builder now distinguishes its three valid active-manifest states:\n\n- exact authenticated issue #1747 predecessor: materialize issue #1748;\n- issue #1748 same release: rebuild and validate normally;\n- authenticated release newer than issue #1748: validate successor custody and perform no writes.\n\nMalformed or forged predecessor and same-release state remains fail-closed.\n\nFixes #1749.\n\n## Cause and user impact\n\n`main()` previously treated every active manifest whose `issue` was not `1748` as a successor. In the intended pre-release state, the active manifest is legitimately issue #1747, so `validate_checked_release()` entered its successor path and rejected the release because `1747` is not greater than `1748`. This aborted the Functions materialization before any output could be written.\n\nThe first repair still trusted any parseable active manifest with `issue == 1748`. A forged same-release manifest could therefore enter the build loop and be overwritten with canonical output, washing away the invalid input instead of failing closed.\n\n## Fix\n\n- Restrict successor preservation to integer issue identities strictly newer than `1748`.\n- Admit issue #1747 only when the active manifest has the pinned predecessor SHA-256 and is raw-byte identical to the immutable issue #1747 snapshot.\n- Admit same-release issue #1748 only when both active and immutable snapshot manifests have the pinned identity and SHA-256 and are raw-byte identical, then use the normal deterministic rebuild path.\n- Add adversarial regression coverage for authentic predecessor, forged predecessor, authentic same release, forged/malformed same release, and the current issue #1749 successor.\n- Assert forged/malformed issue #1748 state makes zero build/write/validation calls and preserves SHA-256, byte size, and mtime for every existing JSON artifact.\n- Prove the current issue #1749 successor remains a no-write path with unchanged SHA-256, byte length, and mtime for every P1 JSON artifact.\n\nNo semantic artifacts, structural authority, provider data, runtime surfaces, or frontend files changed.\n\n## Exact custody\n\n- base SHA: `8c874709e0da16fc2f48ee83c2a6e0d5c8e4c7fb`\n- base tree: `7dff04154ca753da09ddb786d9228881fa872321`\n- repair head: `5b3122fc60facf53def42e4810a09f3cfa581bf9`\n- repair tree: `3fe7c16fdd003b003ab453a9259597279a21544b`\n- active #1749 manifest: `63754b8b0cf1fad141c4ee4ce541a9d4a1b103c144ec2550b7b667983fbbd98c` (`11279` bytes)\n- immutable #1747 manifest: `ba3f7608fb57cc02c2da48187c7de4f0078f16c44d6de8debfe57baad46cd47a` (`8925` bytes)\n- immutable #1748 manifest: `1842d9e62503c26ab43b7bd02e2c4c9ce30390cf25c7c1ad30347cfe3efee2bf` (`9861` bytes)\n- Functions delta: `da28dbb1f81fd23de50cd8ab776f5fd77de5521109c82e5ccc15304f94d099db`\n- Quadratics delta: `841305c7b6c03cae36d3eaf4566e2a217a0c78be5d306cd55fde1752049e78ac`\n- cumulative projection: `2d48eed24d145b8d8e025d81a3ce069d1dd0449a9dd1eda663a8589710262835`\n- terminal ledger: `eba9aa14564c8174d8fab523b4981eea537eef68061d429e3ac15bbe1fb5befb`\n- product readback: `3d3304c1787d91e5dd6a0f280efee089dcd059629c575af552f67f469ca6965a`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1748_p1_functions_semantic_kg.py --check` — PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1749_p1_quadratics_semantic_kg.py --check` — PASS\n- focused issue #1748 suite — `18/18`\n- focused issue #1749 suite — `12/12`\n- P1 predecessor suites #1744–#1747, strictly serial — `44/44`\n- P3 suites #1722–#1727, strictly serial — `61/61`\n- authenticated readback service/API/real gateway Jest suites with `--runInBand` — `92/92`\n- Python compilation — PASS\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\n- governed preflight — expected warning only for the intentional two-file task diff before commit; branch safety and workflow guards healthy\n\nStatus: `ready_for_re-review`.\n","created_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:45Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T00:46:26Z","closed_at":"2026-07-29T00:28:36Z","merged_at":"2026-07-29T00:28:36Z","merge_commit_sha":"a19076ecd9ae2bf04e6452803b149ace10380acc","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1759/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1759/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/re